+- `0017-policy-input-sanitization.patch` — policy input sanitization
+- `0018-authorization-block-visible-state.patch` — authorization block visible state
+- `0019-merchant-rzp-real-payout.patch` — merchant rzp real payout
+- `0020-fix-reference-id-collision.patch` — fix reference id collision
+- `0021-add-merchant-rzp-to-catalog.patch` — add merchant rzp to catalog
+- `0022-wallet-policy-panels.patch` — wallet policy panels
+- `0023-real-balance-check.patch` — real balance check
+- `0024-payout-poll-classification.patch` — payout poll classification
+- `0025-fix-workflow-complete-reconciliation-check.patch` — fix workflow complete reconciliation check
+- `0026-flagship-downstream-failure-reversal.patch` — flagship downstream failure reversal
+- `0027-phase5-pending-payout-resolution.patch` — phase5 pending payout resolution
+- `0028-phase6-preset2-reconciliation-demo.patch` — phase6 preset2 reconciliation demo
